Package: GynRepanel
Title: Gynecologic Multi-Omic Cross-Cohort Integration Benchmark
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("TJ", "OGZT", email="tjogzt@example.com", role=c("aut","cre"))
Description: Implements the three-paradigm integration benchmark for OV/UCEC/CESC
    with undecidability classification per SPIRIT 2013. Provides the layer-dose
    response curve (2->5 omics layers), the NRCR 20-item reproducibility scaffold,
    the MDD-based undecidability classifier (purity gate G2, and the RAINBO
    ProMisE/CN_LOW mis-calibration quantification utility.  Local equivalence packages
    intNMFequiv and MCIAequiv are available via Remotes (Suggests); their
    installed versions are reported on package load.
